Prince: Hey Nacho.
-> Prince: How are you?
-> Prince: Follow me.
    Nacho: Sure.
    <<Follow "Nacho" "Prince">>
    <<stop>>
-> Prince: Stay here.
    Nacho: Alright, I’ll be here.
    <<StopFollow "Nacho">>
    <<stop>>
-> Prince: {GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Nacho", 0)}
    <<jump {GetDialogueTopicNodeName("Nacho", 0)}>>
-> Prince: {GetDialogueTopicOptionText("Nacho", 1)}
    <<jump {GetDialogueTopicNodeName("Nacho", 1)}>>
